Emerging Healthcare Trends Driving Market Evolution
From 2025 onward, digital transformation is playing a defining role in the next era of cardiac care. Trends reshaping the market include:
•	AI-assisted ECG interpretation
•	Remote monitoring enabled implantables
•	MRI-compatible and leadless pacemakers
•	Advanced sensor-based wearable cardiac devices
